			"id": "result",
			"shows": "The finished courtyard seen from its doorway, the sun behind the camera, under the Clear preset and under the Golden Hour preset. It has the room and yard probes, the wet floor and screen-space reflections, and each preset has its own baked probes.",
			"caption": "The finished courtyard at noon and at dusk, each with its own baked probes. Notice the sphere: it mirrors the room, its walls and the bright doorway, not the sky. The wet floor mirrors the soil bed. At noon the sun lays a short patch inside the door, at dusk a long band across the floor and a warm patch on the back wall.",
			"alt": "The inside of a plaster room seen from its doorway, with a mirror-like metal sphere on the left and a dark soil bed against the back wall, on a dark polished floor. In the first picture the light is a neutral gray, and the sun lays a short pale patch on the floor inside the door. The sphere shows the pale walls of the room and the bright doorway, and the floor mirrors the soil bed. In the second the whole room turns warm orange, the sphere mirrors the warm room and a long band of sunlight crosses the floor. A door-shaped patch of light, with the shadow of the sphere, lies on the back wall.",
